 🎬\nPeople of Parkside Sunset is excited to help bring outdoor movie nig
 hts back to our neighborhood! Every Friday in October\, grab your blankets
 \, bring the kids\, and join your neighbors at McCoppin Square. ✨\n📍 
 Taraval @ 23rd Ave\n🕠 5:30 PM every Friday\n\nThis year’s lineup:\n
 🐉 Oct 2: How to Train Your Dragon\n🚗 Oct 9: Bad Guys 2\n🦊 Oct 16:
  Zootopia 2\n💨 Oct 23: Sonic the Hedgehog\n🍌 Oct 30: Despicable Me 4
 \n🎉 FREE movies\n🌭 FREE food\n🍿 FREE popcorn\n👨‍👩‍👧
 ‍👦 Family fun for all ages!\nWhile you’re here\, stop by the shops 
 and restaurants along Taraval and make a night of it! 🛍️🍴@pops_sf\
 nPeople of Parkside Sunset\nThe mission of POPS is to unite the community 
 of the Parkside Sunset District through commerce\, community organization 
