DESCRIPTION:Two rising but reckless Naval officers – Pete “Maverick”
  Mitchell and Nick “Goose” Bradshaw – are recruited for Top Gun\; an
  elite US Flying school for advanced fighter pilots.\n\nThere\, the macho 
 classmates engage in a dangerous competition to outdo their rivals and Mav
 erick begins a relationship with a civilian instructor.\n\nAbout Floating 
 Features\n\nSan Francisco Legacy Businesses Red and White Fleet and The Ro
 xie are partnering to turn the hybrid electric vessel Enhydra into a saili
 ng cinema for a limited run of nighttime film cruises on the Bay. Join us 
 this autumn for a 2-hour twilight cruise and a feature film handpicked by 
 the Roxie. Our electric vessel means no engine noise and a totally unique 
 al fresco movie experience.\n\nFull schedule available here.\n\nRuntime\n\
 n1h 50m\n\nYear\n\n1986\n\nDirector\n\nTony Scott\n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nCoun
 try\n\nUSA\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish\n\nFirst Showing\n\nOctober 9\, 2026\n\n
 Categories\n\nFloating Features 2026\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\, Floating Features
 \n\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/9/floating-features-top-g
 un-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
