DESCRIPTION:In this martial arts film\, Ning Choi-san (Leslie Cheung)\, a 
 traveling tax collector\, takes shelter for the night in an abandoned temp
 le. When he meets the lovely maiden Nip Siu-sin (Tsu-hsien Wang)\, Ning im
 mediately falls for her. Unfortunately\, Ning later discovers that she is 
 a ghost who is forced to serve a cruel demon\, and he resolves to save her
  from the evil spirit. Enlisting the aid of Taoist warrior Yin Chik-hsia (
 Ma Wu)\, Ning ventures into a supernatural realm to save Nip's soul.\n\nDe
 tails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/a-chinese-ghost-story-ticket
 s\nSource: DoTheBay
