UID:dothebay-17931647@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:1
CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:In 9 TO 5\, a group of female office workers – the all-knowi
 ng manager who trained the boss but can't get promoted (Lily Tomlin)\, a b
 efuddled newcomer (Jane Fonda)\, and an alluring personal secretary everyo
 ne presumes is having an affair (Dolly Parton) – all band together to se
 ek revenge on the man who is making their lives miserable. Directed by Col
 in Higgins and produced by Bruce Gilbert from a screenplay by Higgins and 
 Patricia Resnick\, 9 TO 5 received an Academy Award® nomination for the h
 it title song written and performed by Dolly Parton.\n\nDisney will donate
  net proceeds* from each U.S. ticket purchase to The Dollywood Foundation 
 to support its flagship program\, Dolly Parton’s Imagination Library.\n\
 n*Net proceeds refers to the amount received by Disney from the U.S. theat
 rical ticket sale for the film during the period October 9-15\, 2026\, les
 s (a) amounts retained by exhibitors\, (b) third-party distribution fees a
 nd expenses\, (c) third-party marketing and advertising expenses incurred 
 in connection with the campaign\, and (d) CAF America's administrative fee
 s.\n\nLearn more at cafamerica.org and dollywoodfoundation.org.\n\nDetails
 : https://dothebay.com/events/2026/10/10/9-to-5-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
