SUMMARY:French Movie Night: “Making Of” w/ English Subtitles
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261013T200000
DTSTAMP:20261006T001646Z
UID:funcheap-1639787@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerAlliance Française de San Fra
 nciscoHave a good time enjoying a thrilling movie\, while improving your F
 rench! All movies will be screened in French with English subtitles.\nSyno
 psis: Simon\, a seasoned director\, begins filming a movie about a group o
 f workers fighting to save their factory. But between his producer’s sha
 dy dealings\, egocentric actors\, and a crew on edge\, he quickly finds hi
 mself overwhelmed. Abandoned by his financiers\, Simon must face a labor d
 ispute with his own team. Amidst this hellish shoot\, his only ally is the
