BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Salon: The Living Room – Colossus: AI\, Control and The Human Qu
 estion
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20261014T213000
DTSTAMP:20261014T171851Z
UID:funcheap-1640654@sf-cal
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Movies
DESCRIPTION:Submitted by the Event OrganizerTracy SwedlowThe Living Room: 
 A TV of Tomorrow Salon “After Hours” is an intimate evening of film\, 
 science fiction\, artificial intelligence\, technology\, speakers and conv
 ersation—exploring how popular culture imagined AI long before it became
  part of everyday life.\n​Featuring a screening of the prophetic AI clas
 sic Colossus: The Forbin Project\, the evening also unearths obscure and h
 ard-to-find clips from films\, television\, games and online media that ee
 rily foreshadow our AI-driven present. Sometimes hopeful\, sometimes cauti
 onary\, these visions keep returning to the same essential question: Where
  do humans fit in?\n\n​Have something to show us? We’re inviting creat
 ors to submit short videos (under 5 minutes) exploring AI\, technology\, s
 cience fiction\, television\, or our changing relationship with machines. 
 Selected shorts may be screened during the evening. Experimental\, narrati
 ve\, animated\, AI-generated and just plain strange are all welcome. To su
 bmit: tracy@tvotshow.com\n​“COLOSSUS: The Forbin Project”\n​In the
  chillingly prescient 1970 sci-fi thriller Colossus: The Forbin Project\, 
 humanity builds a supercomputer to eliminate the possibility of nuclear wa
 r—only to discover that the machine has its own ideas about how to keep 
 us safe. When Colossus connects with its Soviet counterpart\, the two rapi
 dly evolve beyond human understanding and conclude that the surest path to
  peace is to take control themselves. More than 50 years later\, the film 
 feel...\n\n$20.00\n\nTickets: https://luma.com/6393lfh3\nDetails: https://
 sf.funcheap.com/salon-living-room-colossus-ai-control-human-question/\nSou
 rce: Funcheap SF
IMAGE;VALUE=URI:https://cdn.funcheap.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/The_Li
 ving_Room_COLOSSUS_No1_Printful_50x70cm_300dpi.jpg
LAST-MODIFIED:20261014T171851Z
LOCATION:Ocean Room\, 350 Ocean Room\, San Francisco\, CA 94112
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://sf.funcheap.com/salon-living-room-colossus-ai-control-human-qu
 estion/
END:VEVENT
