DESCRIPTION:The San Francisco Standard invites you to\nSundown Cinema: Bee
 tlejuice\nPresented by Amazon\n\nFriday\, October 16 | Crane Cove Park\n\n
 Come dressed in your best costume and join the Halloween costume contest b
 efore the movie!\n\nRSVP for a chance to win special access to the reserve
 d seating section. Plus\, Amazon is gifting one lucky winner up to $1\,000
  for their Amazon Wish List.\n\nOfficial Rules: https://sfstandard.com/sun
 down-cinema-2026-sweepstakes\n\nHelp support the SF-Marin Food Bank by bri
 nging canned goods to Sundown Cinema. There will be a truck on site that w
 ill make a delivery to the food bank following the screening. Learn more a
 bout the SF Marin Food Bank at https://www.sfmfoodbank.org.\n\nEVENT INFOR
 MATION:\n\nAdmission is free and open to all - make sure to get there earl
 y to secure a spot!\nFilm screening begins after sunset (around 6:20 pm).\
 nMake sure to bring a blanket and warm clothes.\nLeashed and crowd-friendl
 y dogs are welcome.\nParking is very limited. We recommend walking\, bikin
 g\, or taking public transportation.\nBring low-profile chairs only. Tall 
 chairs must stay on the edges — don’t block someone else’s view!\n\n
 ABOUT THE SAN FRANCISCO STANDARD:\nThe San Francisco Standard is the Bay A
 rea’s fastest growing source for news and information. Whether it’s an
  investigation into political corruption or a guide to the best wine bars 
 in town\, we provide San Francisco—one of the most dynamic cities in the
  world—with the journalism it deserves. Visit sfstandard.com to learn mo
 re...\n\nFree\nThe San Francisco Standard Presents\n\nTickets: https://sfs
 tandard.fillout.com/t/iTVWK53bEmus\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2
 026/10/16/sundown-cinema-beetlejuice-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
