  of San Francisco Art Institute (SFAI) alumni\, faculty\, and staff. Follo
 wing a kick-off event at SFMOMA on October 18\, the main program will take
  place November 6-8 at the 4-Star and Roxie Theaters in San Francisco. Pro
 grams will include films by George Kuchar\, Ed Jones\, Rock Ross\, Dean Sn
 ider\, Michael Rudnick\, and special event with Babeth Mondini-VanLoo\, wi
 th films starring the Sex Pistols\, Andy Warhol\, and the sounds of Cabare
 t Voltaire.\n\nFree to $20.\n\nPresented by SF Artists Alumni.\n\nFree\nSF
