CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a screening of When ICE Melts\, a documentary on t
 he Minneapolis resistance to the 2025 ICE raids\, capturing the role of un
 ions\, immigrant organizations\, workers’ assemblies\, and rapid respons
 e networks in building solidarity against the federal occupation.\n\nThe f
 ilm also documents the case of the Minnesota 15 — class members persecut
 ed by the federal government for simple acts of solidarity — and stands 
 as evidence of what happened and what is coming.\n\nAfter the screening\, 
 filmmaker Kip Hedges will be present to kick off a discussion on how we de
 fend civil liberties in this country\, the role unions must play\, and wha
 t it will take to build a real defense front.\n\nDetails: https://dothebay
 .com/events/2026/10/28/when-ice-melts-tickets\nSource: DoTheBay
