DESCRIPTION:Director Babeth Mondini-VanLoo and Special Guest in person for
  Q&A moderated by Gaetano Kazuo Maid Executive Director of the Buddhist Fi
 lm Foundation.\n\nThis new film offers a unique\, intimate\, and wide-rang
 ing view of the 14th Dalai Lama through his longterm engagement with the p
 eople of The Netherlands including members of the royal family and leading
  artists and intellectuals. The Dalai Lama’s powerful message of inner p
 eace and his concern for the planet and universal connectedness are inspir
 ing antidotes for a world full of challenges\, polarization\, and war. Fea
 turing Tenzin Gyatso-the 14th Dalai Lama\, Richard Gere\, Ani Jinpa\, the 
 Princess of Orange\, Tsering Jampa\, David Bohm\, and others.\n\nRuntime\n
 \n1h 34m\n\nYear\n\n2026\n\nDirector\n\nBabeth Mondini-VanLoo\n\nFormat\n\
 nDCP\n\nCountry\n\nThe Netherlands\n\nLanguage\n\nEnglish & Dutch with Eng
