LOCATION:SHACK 15\, 1 Ferry Building #Suite 201\, San Francisco\, CA\, 941
 11
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
URL:https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/12/cue-the-music-tickets
END:VEVENT
