 d snapshot of a vanished creative world.\nPart of the Psychedelic Film Ser
 ies at Live Worms / Church of Mother Gong.\n\nWednesday\, November 18 at 7
  PM1345 Grant Ave.\, San FranciscoFree\n\nFree\n\nTickets: https://www.eve
 ntbrite.com/e/1989057550678?aff=oddtdtcreator\nDetails: https://sf.funchea
