DESCRIPTION:Zann’s Staff Pick!\n\nWhen vaudeville star Velma Kelly (Cath
 erine Zeta-Jones) is arrested for the murder of her two-timing husband\, s
 he enlists a smooth-talking attorney (Richard Gere) to grease the wheels o
 f her public image and avoid a death sentence. Meanwhile\, up and comer Ro
 xie Hart (Renée Zellweger) has arrived on Murderess’ Row and will use e
 very trick in the book to keep the spotlight on her own predicament. This 
 jazz-age tale of jealousy\, deceit\, and fame earned six Academy Awards\, 
 including Best Picture\, and remains a musical favorite decades after its 
 release.\n\nRuntime\n\n1h 53m\n\nYear\n\n2002\n\nDirector\n\nRob Marshall\
 n\nFormat\n\nDCP\n\nFirst Showing\n\nNovember 18\, 2026\n\nCategories\n\nS
 taff Picks\n\n\,\n\nFeatured\n\nTickets: https://ticketing.uswest.veezi.co
