CATEGORIES:Film
DESCRIPTION:Another Planet Entertainment presents\nLa Bola Negra\nMonday\,
  November 23 | ​The Castro\n\nFrom Cannes-winning directors Javier Calvo
  and Javier Ambrossi — popularly known as Los Javis — La Bola Negra fo
 llows three generations of men across pivotal moments in Spanish history\,
  bound by pain\, desire\, and love. Carlos (Milo Quifes) longs to belong i
 n a fractured Spain. Sebastián (Guitarricadelafuente) finds connection ac
 ross enemy lines. And Alberto (Carlos González) uncovers a long-buried fa
 mily secret — one that finally gives voice to truths the past tried to e
 rase.\n\nDestined to become a classic of LGBTQ cinema\, La Bola Negra is a
  must-see cinematic event. Don’t miss your chance to experience it at Th
 e Castro Theatre!\n\nRated R\nAnother Planet Entertainment presents\nListe
 d time is doors\n\nTickets: https://thecastro.com/events/la-bola-negra-261
 123\nDetails: https://dothebay.com/events/2026/11/23/la-bola-negra-tickets
 \nSource: DoTheBay
